Usage: symcockpit fan set <0.0-1.0>
       symcockpit fan auto
       symcockpit fan profile [system|comfort|performance]
       symcockpit fan status
       symcockpit fan target [<50-85>|off]   (Cool: max average CPU/GPU cluster °C)
       symcockpit fan governor [--state <path>]   (requires root)
